  "description": "The Macaroni 24 upsizes the original Macaroni’s comfort and style points for most kids between the ages of 7 and 12 years old. The Macaroni is created around the BMX principles of having a bike that is durable enough for everyday use and that will also be simple to maintain over the years.\n\nThis bike’s geometry lets riders feel at home during seated pedaling and leaves room to grow. A special edition book about the adventures of Macaroni the Unicorn Tiger is included with each bike to add to the fun and to get kids excited to ride. Affordably priced and always a joy to pedal. Everyone loves macaroni.\n\nAvailable in Suff Blue with 20\" wheels and 24\" wheels.\n\n24\" wheels with a more natural riding position for young riders\n\nBMX inspired simplicity and durability keeps riding easy and fun\n\nAdjustable railed seat for growth\n\nOdyssey Path Pro tires\n\nOdyssey Springfield brake lever\n\nOdyssey Springfield brake\n\nSunday Freeze top load stem\n\nFairdale Swan grips\n\nFSA sealed headset",
